DusdPegOracleCurve::constructor()
├── given initialOwner is the zero address
│   ├── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner(address(0))
│   └── it should perform no pool or factory validation
├── given initialOwner is valid
│   ├── given a required configuration address is zero
